MSVC conformance corpus -- tests/conformance/msvc-llvm-corpus.txt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The mangled names are LLVM's demangler test corpus (llvm/test/Demangle/ms-*.test),
used under the Apache License 2.0 with the LLVM exception. The expected column
was produced by running llvm-undname over them.

